keywords:
  - astronomy
  - transients
  - explainable AI
  - benchmark
  - deep learning
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark that evaluates the quality of machine-learning explanations
  along five complementary axes -- perturbation-based faithfulness,
  deletion/insertion AUC, complexity, cross-representation plausibility, and the
  model- and data-randomisation sanity checks -- for classifiers of
  astronomical transients on the PLAsTiCC dataset.
